  "upstream_context": {
    "confirmed_mainline": "LightGBM / XGBoost / Logistic Regression 等表格/统计模型负责数值 scoring，Qwen3 负责审计解释、reason code、RAG 引用和缺字段检查，最终交易放行由 deterministic final gate 决定。",
